    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRIKEWAVE is a platform fighter with mechanics honed for both precision and accessibility. Wave dash away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><i> </i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight up to four-player in local PvP combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform brawl over multiple locations each with unique visuals and layout\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 moves per character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab weapons and powerups that appear in the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid falling off the ledge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features simulated blood, violent acts, accidental death, bodily injury, and killing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand and weaponized combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pixel graphics are stylized and not realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a platform fighter but darker than most</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRIKEWAVE is a platform fighter with mechanics honed for both precision and accessibility. Wave dash away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><i> </i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight up to four-player in local PvP combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform brawl over multiple locations each with unique visuals and layout\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 moves per character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab weapons and powerups that appear in the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid falling off the ledge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features simulated blood, violent acts, accidental death, bodily injury, and killing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand and weaponized combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pixel graphics are stylized and not realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a platform fighter but darker than most</p></li></ul>",
